     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic policy reform and management and private sector development</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2022, PSDI&#x2019;s tourism program supported the Tourism Authority of Kiribati (TAK) to develop sustainability indicators to assess tourism in Kiribati, and to shift away from the use of international visitor arrivals as the sole measure of tourism success.  
&#x200d;
In 2023, the program is assisting TAK to develop its Strategic Plan 2023-2026 alongside a new national Sustainable Tourism Policy. Support for both supply and demand analysis will follow and lead to the development of a 10-year tourism master plan to support ongoing recovery, growth, sustainability, and long-term sector resilience.</narrative>
    </description>
